            "label": "CO1",
            "raw_text": "Understand advanced multimedia  and social media computing applications and latest technologies"
        },
        {
            "label": "CO2",
            "raw_text": "Knowledge of crawling strategies and underlying content processing, content transformation, resource optimization, and multi-source data fusion techniques"
        },
        {
            "label": "CO3",
            "raw_text": "Enable in formulating novel approaches for future multimedia computing and social media computing applications"
        },
        {
            "label": "CO4",
            "raw_text": "Use evaluation strategies to analyze results, preparing report, and visually present the insights"
        }
    ],
